-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 6.8, November 21, 2025

3/20/25  [EDGcpfe/28044]
Version check for <stdfloat> types

The version test for C++23 in stdfloat.stdh was redundant with the feature
macro tests for each of the <stdfloat> types; furthermore, it prevented use
of the header in Microsoft mode, since MSVC does not set __cplusplus to the
value corresponding to the language version.  The test has now been removed.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 6.7, January 29, 2025

2/13/24  [EDGcpfe/27005]
Copyright notice in prototype header files

The prototype header files have been updated to include a copyright notice
to make it explicit that those files can be distributed provided the copyright
notice is preserved.


