Version 4.8, October 18, 2013

8/28/13 [EDGcpfe/9167,EDGcpfe/12359]
C++11: Support for thread_local

The __cxa_thread_atexit function has been added to cxxabi.h.  This routine
is invoked by the front end (in IA-64 ABI configurations) to register
destructions for thread_local variables that should occur when the current
thread terminates.


